GET {{API_HostAddress}}/json-item
Accept: text/event-stream
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Test SSE endpoint - strongly-typed SseItem<T> with reconnection metadata
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/sse-item
Accept: text/event-stream
Cache-Control: no-cache

### Test OpenAPI endpoint
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

